OL,3,ADrayton Manor worker sexually assaulted
OL,4,A19 girls
OL,5,
OL,6,FA theme park ride operator has pleaded
OL,7,Fguilty to assaulting 19 girls, all
OL,8,Funder the age of 13.
OL,10,FConcerns were first raised about Josef
OL,11,FLuke Hammond, 24, from Birmingham,
OL,12,Fafter a girl told her parent he had
OL,13,Ftouched her inappropriately while at
OL,14,FDrayton Manor Theme Park in
OL,15,FStaffordshire.
OL,17,FHammond, who worked as a ride operator
OL,18,Fat the park from March 2024 to August
OL,19,F2024, was arrested after CCTV was
OL,20,Freviewed.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
